    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "You are writing a program that describes what to do at a traffic light.\r\n\r\n**Do This**\r\n\r\n1. Simulate a red light! Run the code, type “yes”, then “yes” again, and observe what happens.\r\n2. Simulate a green light! Run the code, type “yes”, then “no”, and observe what happens.\r\n3. This code works for red and green lights, but it doesn’t work for yellow lights. Update the program to also ask if the light is yellow. If the light is yellow, the program should print “Stop if you can.”",
